{
  "_comment": [
    "Trader price data. 'value' is what ONE unit is worth; a trader pays",
    "value * market.sellMultiplier for it and charges value * count *",
    "market.buyMultiplier for a listing. Entries without \"buy\": true can be",
    "sold but are not stocked - the barter junk that only flows one way.",
    "Override this file from a datapack at the same path to retune the economy.",
    "NOT EVERYTHING NEEDS A ROW HERE. TACZ guns and ammo are priced from their own",
    "ballistics, and armour with no entry is priced AND stocked from its own stats",
    "(see DerivedPrices and the [derived] config block) - which is what makes a gear",
    "mod shipping 238 armour pieces workable.",
    "KEY FORMATS: a plain item id; 'tacz:gun/<id>' or 'tacz:ammo/<id>'; or",
    "'<item id>/<variant id>' for mods that put many items on one registry name via",
    "NBT, listed in market.nbtVariantItems - LesRaisins Tactical works that way, so",
    "its medkits are lrtactical:consumable/lrtactical:ai2 and NOT lrtactical:ai2,",
    "which is not a registered item at all.",
    "Optional \"sub\" on an entry files it into a section inside its category",
    "(e.g. \"category\": \"gear\", \"sub\": \"backpacks\"). Armour sections and gun",
    "sections are derived from equipment slot and TACZ gun type automatically."
  ],
